firmware-ci's baseline app. Every file here is firmware-ci's own (Apache-2.0, as
nopekit is), except the six partition rows in partitions.csv.

partitions.csv is ESP-IDF's two-OTA partition table,
components/partition_table/partitions_two_ota.csv, from
https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf at v5.5.6 (880a203ae603), with its header
comment. ESP-IDF is Copyright 2015-2025 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

main/main.c, the two CMakeLists.txt, sdkconfig.defaults and
github/workflows/build.yml are written for this pack. They call ESP-IDF's public
APIs (esp_sleep.h, driver/rtc_io.h, nimble/nimble_port.h) and build in ESP-IDF's
own image, espressif/idf v5.5.6, pinned by digest in the workflow.
